  "notes": "Slug idefics-1 because huggingface.idefics is the family id; Hugging Face later calls this model Idefics1 (Idefics2 announcement). An open reproduction of DeepMind's Flamingo built on frozen LLaMA v1 (65B for the 80B variant, 7B for the 9B variant) and LAION CLIP-ViT-H-14 backbones joined by newly trained layers; these cross-organisation relations are not recorded here. The Hub repositories were created in July 2023, before the announcement; the release date is the blog date. Training sequence lengths in the card (1024 and 2048) are not a stated context window, so contextWindowTokens is left out.",
